cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the en_ud_trf_l1 model or this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "en_ud_trf_l1: a spaCy transformer POS tagger and Universal Dependencies parser for English"
abstract: >-
  A RoBERTa-based spaCy pipeline (transformer, tagger, parser) that predicts
  Penn Treebank XPOS tags and UD v2 dependency relations for English, trained
  on openly licensed UD treebanks (EWT, GUM, Pronouns, PUD) as a redistributable
  replacement for en_ud_L1_combined_trf in V-CAT.
authors:
